description=v3.8.3, the precision round: the battery at two decimals, in the status bar. charge_counter on this phone reports level x 60000 uAh and only steps at whole percents, so the hundredths come from integrating the live current between the gauge anchors - the number glides at the real pace of use and charge, agrees with the system percentage at every whole, and costs nothing: no wake locks, no alarms, screen-off silence by construction. Tap-to-toggle on the setup screen. Suite: 674 checks, 0 failed.
